    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Demeter is an <strong>arcade twin stick shooter</strong> that relies on pure skill.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls and an intuitive game design,<strong><i> can you get the high score?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Four distinct enemy types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/acbc265f5995ab931d6cf0e6fd49d9b4.poster.avif?t=1732868484\" width=420 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/acbc265f5995ab931d6cf0e6fd49d9b4.webm?t=1732868484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/acbc265f5995ab931d6cf0e6fd49d9b4.mp4?t=1732868484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of wave types</strong>, increasing in difficulty the longer you survive </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/84c3f9122002693dc6aebb6f8858ac16.poster.avif?t=1732868484\" width=420 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/84c3f9122002693dc6aebb6f8858ac16.webm?t=1732868484\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3127350/extras/84c3f9122002693dc6aebb6f8858ac16.mp4?t=1732868484\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>30 music tracks</strong> to help you find your flow</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.